---
title: Sequence — Knowledge Ingestion & Indexing
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Trig as Trigger<br/>(webhook · cron · manual CLI)
    participant Sync as IncrementalSync
    participant Git as GitAdapter
    participant Code as CodebaseIndexer
    participant Jira as JiraConnector
    participant Conf as ConfluenceConnector
    participant LinkSrc as LiveLinkScraper
    participant Tribe as TribalKnowledgeLoader
    participant Chunk as Chunker+Embedder
    participant LLM as ModelAPIConnector
    participant Vec as VectorStore (pgvector)
    participant Meta as Metadata (Postgres)
    participant Doc as DocumentStore
    participant Orch as KBOrchestrator
    participant QA as Q&A Bot

    Trig->>Sync: tick / event {source, since}

    par Source pulls
        Sync->>Git: pull changes since LAST_SHA
        Git-->>Sync: diffs · files · commit meta
        Sync->>Code: index AST + symbols
        Code-->>Sync: symbol graph
    and
        Sync->>Jira: fetch updated issues
        Jira-->>Sync: issues · ACs · labels
    and
        Sync->>Conf: fetch updated pages
        Conf-->>Sync: pages · attachments
    and
        Sync->>LinkSrc: fetch URLs (whitelist)
        LinkSrc-->>Sync: cleaned HTML/text
    and
        Sync->>Tribe: load manual drops
        Tribe-->>Sync: markdown · transcripts
    end

    Sync->>Chunk: normalize + split (semantic, 800-1200 tok)
    Chunk->>LLM: embed(batch)
    LLM-->>Chunk: vectors[1536]
    Chunk->>Vec: upsert(id, vector, source_ref)
    Chunk->>Doc: store raw + chunks
    Chunk->>Meta: upsert(doc_id, source, tags, hash, version)

    Sync->>Orch: notify(updated_ids)
    Orch->>Orch: invalidate dependent caches
    Orch-->>QA: refresh retrieval index

    Note over QA,Vec: Query path<br/>QA → Orch.query(q) → Vec.knn + Meta.filter → LLM.answer
